msgid ""
"Dyflexis is specialized in the development of the most user-friendly software and hardware for workforce management. More than 3200 companies in hospitality, recreation, Retail & E-commerce, production & warehousing and healthcare are using our system daily. "
"They rate us with 4.8/5 from 400+ reviews on Trustpilot. More information is available in the enclosed brochure: "
